{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國知名高校範德堡大學近日遭遇一起嚴重網絡安全事件。校方表示，目前正在應對一場仍在進行中的網絡安全事故，該事件可能波及學校設備、內部系統以及多項雲服務。為降低風險，學校已緊急要求學生、教師及其他工作人員關閉學校配發的設備，斷開校園無線網絡連接，並密切關注設備是否出現異常情況。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585690.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.165759+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:37:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"9b1ac54b1e6361a672989372da5fee1f7926dae57476add083596f1cc8df866a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}